Route12_Text_FishermanKyleIntro::
	.string "Do you remember?$"

Route12_Text_FishermanKyleDefeat::
	.string "You do remember?$"

Route12_Text_FishermanKyle::
	.string "The tug you feel on the ROD when\n"
	.string "you hook a POKéMON...\p"
	.string "That’s the best feeling ever for\n"
	.string "an angler like me.$"

Route12_Text_FishermanMartinIntro::
	.string "Patience is the key to both fishing\n"
	.string "and POKéMON.$"

Route12_Text_FishermanMartinDefeat::
	.string "Gwaaah!$"

Route12_Text_FishermanMartin::
	.string "I’m too impatient for fishing...$"

Route12_Text_FishermanStephenIntro::
	.string "I feel so content, fishing while\n"
	.string "listening to some tunes on my\l"
	.string "radio.$"

Route12_Text_FishermanStephenDefeat::
	.string "My stupid radio distracted me!$"

Route12_Text_FishermanStephen::
	.string "Have you checked out KANTO’s radio\n"
	.string "stations? We get a good variety here.$"

Route12_Text_FishermanBarneyIntro::
	.string "What’s most important in our\n"
	.string "everyday lives?$"

Route12_Text_FishermanBarneyDefeat::
	.string "The answer is coming up next!$"

Route12_Text_FishermanBarney::
	.string "I think electricity is the most\n"
	.string "important thing in our daily lives.\p"
	.string "If it weren’t, people wouldn’t\n"
	.string "have made such a fuss when the\l"
	.string "POWER PLANT went out of commission.$"

Route12_Text_Sign1::
	.string "FISHING SPOT$"

Route12_Text_Sign2::
	.string "ROUTE 12\n"
	.string "NORTH TO LAVENDER TOWN$"
